<object id="legend" label="Legend&lt;br&gt;Filled arrow: caller → callee. Normal responses are folded into request labels.&lt;br&gt;A (blue): write / metadata sync — publish content and metadata events, poll, upsert.&lt;br&gt;B (orange): read / retrieval — query metadata, retrieve S3 content, save once, return blob reference.&lt;br&gt;Solid: main call (including async publication). Dashed: auxiliary query B1. A/B numbering is independent.&lt;br&gt;Cosmos DB stores metadata; S3 and temporary Blob Storage hold document content." annotationKind="legend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;strokeColor=#98A2B3;fillColor=#F8FAFC;"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="2090" width="2140" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
